{"seq":2,"slug":"algebra-intro","title":"代数入门","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/mathematics/algebra-intro","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"algebraic-expressions","title":"七年级数学 — 代数式","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/mathematics/algebra-intro/algebraic-expressions","wordCount":1526,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"linear-equations","title":"七年级数学 — 一元一次方程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/mathematics/algebra-intro/linear-equations","wordCount":1603,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"inequalities","title":"七年级数学 — 不等式与不等式组","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/mathematics/algebra-intro/inequalities","wordCount":1580,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"代数入门-简介\">代数入门 简介</h1><p>如果说有理数让我们认识了&quot;数的新面貌&quot;，那么代数就是数学送给我们的一门新语言。在这门语言里，字母可以代替未知的数，一个简洁的式子就能概括无数种具体情况。初一代数入门，是从&quot;算术思维&quot;走向&quot;代数思维&quot;的关键跨越。</p>\n<p>本章由三个核心模块组成。<strong>代数式</strong>一节首先教大家用含字母的式子表示数量关系——&quot;比某个数大3&quot;写成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a+3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>，&quot;某个数的两倍&quot;写成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>。看似简单的符号转换，实际上是一种全新的抽象思维训练。<strong>一元一次方程</strong>一节是初一代数的重头戏，同学们将学习如何列方程、如何通过移项和合并同类项一步步求出未知数的值，把生活中的实际问题转化为数学模型来解决。<strong>不等式</strong>一节进一步拓展视野，当答案不再是一个确定的数而是一个范围时，我们需要不等式这个工具来描述&quot;大于&quot;&quot;小于&quot;&quot;至少&quot;&quot;不超过&quot;等关系。</p>\n<p>三个部分从表达到求解再到比较，一步步构建起完整的代数基础。</p>\n<p>学代数最容易犯的错误是&quot;跳步骤&quot;，觉得某一步太简单就跳过。建议同学们养成逐步书写、每步有据的习惯。解方程时不妨将答案代回原方程验算，这个小动作能帮你拦截大多数错误。代数思维一旦建立，它会在你未来所有的理科学习中持续发挥作用。</p>\n"}